============================================================================
Original code / methods
============================================================================

The Pople-Hehre + McMurchie-Davidson (PH+MD) two-electron integral engine
and the Pople-Hehre frame rotation are implemented from the published
algorithm:

  K. Ishimura and S. Nagase, "A new algorithm of two-electron repulsion
  integral calculations: a combination of Pople-Hehre and McMurchie-Davidson
  methods", Theor. Chem. Acc. 120:185-189 (2008),
  DOI: 10.1007/s00214-007-0295-5.

Published equations, algorithms, and physical/mathematical facts are not
copyrightable.

